            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37933096?u=b11a857efbc669246eb43904472627625dcdbbdb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Automatic update generated by <a href=\"https://github.com/ryantm/nixpkgs-update\">nixpkgs-update</a> tools. This update was made based on information from passthru.updateScript.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">meta.description for gh-copilot is: Ask for assistance right in your terminal</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">meta.homepage for gh-copilot is: <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-copilot\">https://github.com/github/gh-copilot</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">meta.changelog for gh-copilot is: <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-copilot/releases/tag/v1.0.5\">https://github.com/github/gh-copilot/releases/tag/v1.0.5</a></p>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">Updates performed</h6>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Ran passthru.UpdateScript</li>\n</ul>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">To inspect upstream changes</h6>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-copilot/releases/tag/v1.0.5\">Release on GitHub</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-copilot/compare/v1.0.1...v1.0.5\">Compare changes on GitHub</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">Impact</h6>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><b>Checks done</b></p>\n<hr>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>built on NixOS</li>\n<li>The tests defined in <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>, if any, passed</li>\n<li>found 1.0.5 with grep in /nix/store/3gskvla7154r3qbbl6pwgcs58bqqkk78-gh-copilot-1.0.5</li>\n<li>found 1.0.5 in filename of file in /nix/store/3gskvla7154r3qbbl6pwgcs58bqqkk78-gh-copilot-1.0.5</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<b>Rebuild report</b> (if merged into master) (click to expand)\n</summary>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"2 total rebuild path(s)\n\n2 package rebuild(s)\n\nFirst fifty rebuilds by attrpath\n\ngh-copilo